### Cassandra JVM Server Options — overrides auto-heap calculation
# Force heap to 512m regardless of available system RAM
-Xms512m
-Xmx512m

# Cap off-heap memory to prevent OOM kills in constrained environments
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=256m
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=128m
-XX:CompressedClassSpaceSize=64m
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=64m

# GC settings compatible with small heap
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:G1HeapRegionSize=8m
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=500
